{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1353,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19542e13a4fd9d57dba67d1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晨光邀请我和她用解谜游戏对战，\r\n似乎是款考验反应速度的游戏啊。\r\n……哼，我可不打算就这么输掉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3024026de2851da08a0fd3970292bac01d5144cf415c09417e46e3081ebcef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1111d29701e5b42ad5b4e46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王在VR里的动作很奇怪啊……\r\n是因为游戏无法还原她那样的柔韧性吗？\r\n哈……居然是在现实里更强的家伙啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13da10680f45c838bb2ad07458f077ec2eca06589aff3b2fa1bacae473676d99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fe6ad1d4c93d66ffbb43323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……刚和涡轮撞了个满怀。\r\n虽然彼此身上都有点小饰品什么的，\r\n但身高方面应该是我占优吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "83508382ae484a1afd1e92ae07ea893c37ec60b40484a07c1d76aeac7a4719fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d7b04f792d8d445a3c7b0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "齿轮这种东西很适合盯着发呆啊……\r\n那样有节奏感的动作和声音……\r\n感觉能一直盯到海枯石烂啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e314e6ced2f2f738879d445a8f7b03895afec4741cabb9b28477e6ec29d9142",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ce3964d2755c3f69142c32c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的朝雾……感觉和以往不一样，\r\n就像是误入了异世界一般啊……\r\n……唉，游戏玩太多了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92a30386ee43ef762c6bd3d2e8dddf183804148e3d1c8e6dab8fa87c371be633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b222dfae9349ee87f3ccc52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……晨光也太哆嗦了吧……\r\n不就是在吃午饭的时候玩了玩游戏嘛……\r\n下次可不能被她发现……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfc24a34513a3bc84fc8b27cea93ffcdb8b57190b1b3f624123b81ad9b520ac7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cd62c404e72f8ba55171a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好险……差点忘了进APP领登录奖励……\r\n要是错过这个的话，\r\n又得推迟装备强化的计划……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b967f1962dde0f1647453cb912b555452108b8565f32037ee5897d81c4b5c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2f5f799000fc051b82992da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近好像暖和起来了……\r\n偶尔也该散步去公园，然后……\r\n玩玩游戏吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ef9450db50fa21cc0580597ceae75a89c236a732ed3a2cd9bb465cf79907558",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b96419c51ee2f478298f321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近游戏的广告尽是些泳装。\r\n怎么说呢……我也蛮讨厌仅仅因此就感觉到夏天的自己的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d444c906f1e9da977b3eea9483ed3d4fe67c19ef0a7a7ef860792d1277164d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11b3abc675ed2410a95cbae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近用VR玩的游戏里，\r\n那些人都用蒸汽来烤地瓜。\r\n呵……真是神奇的世界观啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aecade34cc15a6bc7d5e703a6e69915d1e910cae4c2e5be72bc903365c8e8182",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf386469f20c60623717e07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好冷。玩玩UMA聊天室吧……\r\n在游戏里要取暖可就简单多了。\r\n又玩了游戏又能暖和起来，一石二鸟啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4732ee1b29326fdefbbdc5655537b5df2d2a9d369f053eaad9337bbd55d77b5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ef72f78afea9f7b5a58153c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……嗯，什么？你刚刚说什么？\r\n我耳罩里还塞着耳机，\r\n有点听不清你说话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab89b167e3ec1a7fc427f478a484489a39bb1454713eae88fbe4ae1bbc912e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9212c148ef37d51d2c7da68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我眼睛好得很，没有近视。\r\n……别在昏暗的地方玩游戏，\r\n这种程度的防护措施就足够了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f5b5a9a53b9a9be7a0c987d6939a159e4c3b324c7391c80b2d8b0649e8d3e29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a19c62bc2ce868e6eca8981",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライスって背もアタシと同じぐらい\r\nなのに意外と食べるよね。\r\n何かコツでもあんのかな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bee74ce910a13cb053d4f2949d6fea42a3d92d8c9f442af06e65c252fae3402d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acf9617aea969cc7727c2482",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨日マッチした相手、やたら強いと\r\n思ったらシャカールだったし…。\r\nID覚えたから、次は容赦しない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5de70b8b03a265563303346a777fb251236561457ec1b50f07b82726ffa1f486",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8742a288a30cd0e6324e91f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クリスエスのアドバイス…\r\n意思疎通に必死だからつい\r\n聞き入ったけど、結構的確じゃん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fbede49cb0a6041abce9ec37ec2684b7c5edbf01ed221029dd762926c8da0bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c916a4b9c47411cabf31323c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ギムレットのモクテル。味は悪く\r\nなかったけど、カードのフレーバー\r\nテキストみたいな講釈は何なの？",
      "source_fingerprint": "02a2b3be809e3bde7cd86248027d6c540842d0e6dc7ec9afbb3600ce43884cec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95e24a6217ea421a38d6e714",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "機械の技術が進歩すれば\r\nいつか背が伸びるような\r\nマシンとかもできるのかな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "399932c3a7f03ff39269696918a801c4592a843e4ce2014c10c62b2534c58de4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cc91353e4071d075143b6e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝？早いよ。弁当自分で作ってるし\r\nじゃないとクリークさんが\r\nアタシの分まで作っちゃうから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67f43097ca79bbfc4b2291edc7ecdff4cace1817347427a166b81e1d1ae12812",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e14da441c7abe7e070d4f718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アヤベとかブライアンとは屋上で\r\nたまに会うよ？ほとんど喋んない\r\nけど…何か話したほうがいいのかな",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dece8d914d0974fc35e7052f19019e0b8e1cfc05ce844b93606c09fac278148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4908cbecc982a60fae7d68f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この間、始めたばっかなのに、\r\nもうレベルカンストしてんじゃん。\r\nちょっと寝る前にやりすぎたか…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "775363262a93135245479dfc157579a4c1c28d8fb7eacc4016a2bac2e864af52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5da1496e3da5f9c7683ba9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春は祝い事多いから、実家の\r\n花屋も結構忙しそうにしてたっけ。\r\n…無理とかしてないといいんだけど",
      "source_fingerprint": "437b565e1ff5b06ad1335c5d2158796d9ec9bfefea7059bb04f9e0c2292e2002",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5860da07835b6eae188556e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海か山かって聞かれたら、山。\r\n人少なそうだし…。でも、それより\r\n涼しい部屋でゲームしたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e87b29338f2ef020fc13732d5ebcbbacba351529b94326471eabb84b9d101b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:140a9e0f1b7d6a3ea0780c3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "食欲の秋か…。暇だし料理でも\r\nしよっかな。飾り切りとか\r\n綺麗にできると謎の達成感あるし…",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6363936286e3c9a5908e0fb41066f2302685cd29b962350bcad1fc45c7f9156",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:265985abb65d20c9fae13ef0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "野良猫を膝に乗せたときのぬくぬく\r\nこの時期だからこそだよね。\r\nあの子もやっぱ1人は寒いのかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a093b15db5b56eae96c80930ede75af171fe51f4ae482990aee183282534441",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f23edeb8e05d4b4d7e19526",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目立つのはあんま好きじゃないけど\r\nところどころ光彩入ってサイバーな\r\n感じは…まあ、嫌いじゃないかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b76259ff9216a6dc37770232c0134268f75c8450c382d509f3809114c06da48f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33f0485f591cf64adc4108dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜、これで走ってたらチケットに\r\n流れ星だとか言われたんだけど…。\r\nわかんなくないけど指さすなっての",
      "source_fingerprint": "49eb1997de73ab49a2ce222a43451ad81117d24b3374e6d84b1ac85b7f9076d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c788aed92a86cabe162645d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我就像平时一样就行了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b98a550d645835636aa2fe19bcfda1ecfdc9a73271ca361bfaa3647e63719374",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf06a97bf6168717c6ab353",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やってやる……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2728623afddf1fc87245ca34d13453f44ce90b92313f03d355d1c105d24e64a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c09ddc9bd63a9c361310ac4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样都好……\n但训练可别手软啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29cf79bd883000c465e22130b086b836674a2af7dc82961ca64a3eee9f5391f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd45bd21f0defbb48f67d79b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的……明明做好了准备的！\n为什么会这样啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "224190ef7710c6d64e79bf9c9b23755fdde169165395eb5bffb69af2b34c50ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bed172ba8ccb55d787c89f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是不尽快提高实力，\n立马追上去的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e24fdb738aeb1d1f67a2dea5258cf864dd4a34850f4da610ccf87275e2a1b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:851da39072aadac00dce6367",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛……毕竟你也是训练员嘛。\n我会听从你的指示的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5498c945f293d8d3b1cdf7524e73964ab2262e95cd80998856f10434708cc453",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c71b861a171428dc7ffd52cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用那些多余的担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9cc0df2ad94a6b3096f3f40f7d459e5947bfa44d0fa7381d8a85175d0ac309c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd4224d38b81743a4009ddec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的教导方法……\n还算不错……吧……\n不过热血过了头，吵死人了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c81a3ec50a8afb97f52db9ac61dce09e845fe385a984063f4208068bfc43d5e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c63eca80313df4c2e991f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，快点吧。\n时间很宝贵的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "704b315ec5ad46d7bed9822d35c39ba895df0371a994886dbd21f662e357213e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b326cb304afa872c4d4df9de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "先习惯一下训练节奏，\r\n之后再慢慢加快步调吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0dc82281f335fdb3052dd15242e7c9703d984aabac8502ba5b5f98a6d02986f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:719d3fa6977c50831dfb7a70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "按你的标准来给我打分就行了。\r\n这样的话，我也能更有动力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49616f87284d57a56145cb0b71d5e4f21ff11a6408f3a42c9319c0edeb46d1f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daa2a501019d1bbaa91a1a7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快点开始吧。\r\n热身早就完成了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86833efdde533e1e8b40d08399d29ba6a1f6974c851442a2e2b626cd45e6497c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3b4fb51aad7b7e49b826cca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "TRIAL&ERROR什么的……\r\n现在可不是说这种话的时候。\r\n我可是打从一开始就准备全力以赴的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33b12657e7fc4c41e2d02a0474f86004690726121e875b901e087b64474186f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aa0a13913ee4ad81df71ff6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要和我一起训练的话我倒没什么意见，\r\n但要拖了我的后腿的话我可不干啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62759ae1299490685c259b571af152e3d3d951610c457f099dc77b91729dc6e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:131cb30e6bba1bb4b09db46c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可别太出风头了啊。\r\n……你得搞清楚自己的定位啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c8abb5a041306eb061b21264ca53d81b0c239a222d482b3e4f5e7363df119b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f55255ddc6dc6d5b07dc5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "归根结底，你就是所谓强化役【Buffer】吧。\r\n……后援可要好好加油跟上哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6709e93585c66b90bd06f47eba2286c30288e5478d034e4210f7496c73544313",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64d6eff8d504c16468495633",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "他人のくだらない評価なんて\r\n全部覆してやる…。\r\nとっととトレーニングするよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09f5d6d27d3a0f3c776b47b2502f649ecbc54924947c0e5c4a3ea27f9615a48d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2cfba440bcaef3f472a90e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝つか負けるかゼロかイチか。\r\n勝負って結構デジタルじゃん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ce6ce5f047f94992dd7cd47c8e50deeaba4fbb9eb1a5c91cd89b961af1e1487",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e82cbe24615bcc57e143dee9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パッと見、加速装置とかついてても\r\nおかしくないよね、このシューズ。\r\nまあ、そんなもの必要ないけど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e7ebff16b504d5a0b4a07e358b45cac683023a278fdcdceb5895099175a394f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb07d6209dd20bb1465d3248",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "準備なんてとっくにできてる。\r\nあとはやるだけ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dfd762bc7dc5d9c569e238fb982414eecfb530bda31ff6d72d12826e97a8eee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d8e25494f2051b006c7c3e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目立つ格好してレース出れば\r\nバカなヤツらもわかるでしょ？\r\n誰が1番速いかって。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e483a88a8bc964a5e20ad8c996d88a92a87f6522e4911efb7d867c338fccb2d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f6a750023b1a34581a5a00a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ナメられたら終わりだから、立ち\r\n止まったりしない。ダイナモだって\r\n動いてれば光は消えないでしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "780523da965c8bfdcdd283e6313a602420ac17b243370d780ecbe47e543b58e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af7ebc5857ac34145619ff92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゲームのレベリングも\r\nトレーニングも同じ。結局最後に\r\n大事になるのは積み重ねた量だから",
      "source_fingerprint": "a596790740f8a6c460ea147bf3e28c06535104e33267c149b3d4de4c53031e97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12011ade57f190db89bca1ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你组成一队……嘛，也算不错吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32c864260a744b9782264aad18be990351bbc8b789d6ecd960ca6f2f0d01688a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89d5468d8c71147b250f7f1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯。这不也留下了不错的成果嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fbd49c6266894844b901365d6b76fb8f65b87c2891e9d0bcac34147bc2b2081",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d2f8f73404580ad433ecf62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多谢你的支持啦……还不赖吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e05d9348ba8df24b3808d701e9952344944c8d36d4975440f0c74d8b597c6f61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f1767f4d02c9b5aa75c6cb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不够。下次朝着更高的目标努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9632aa19b8e758e29b8fe7724a4ea8c08657fe73dc152baa7102edc2b01e397c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8875245912783baf7ab7d03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アンタのセットアップ、\r\nまあまあ…よかったよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb655a9adeb305b64d7158771a5b67d64fa2ca6e9880d7498bc83d84260f098b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f0c00938802cff94aef25f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ナイスバックアップ…少しはやるじゃん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21da1e21ed2b70d1fee19001e7d0f08fecaa312c9e94045358721ebb23e30683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d11fbbcb5544266d1b12f226",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不够……还需要再继续磨练……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "200a094c754aeee2450f7256185a84da830dfae09a3f26ab889bc4d88daab4e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:458db0234453e3fa02e84f66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高墙……看我把它们全部破坏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeeede8ba700ba2e77b8a7b28dc4499a45d68334f315cc287c10ab4dba199083",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53588cf80d5c9f781f4da462",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成田大进。\n小瞧我的话就踹飞你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "786b960eb436b08756e5f131a8d6c5e64b0dcea1681cd5dc87b82f260b291de9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21d6cdcc6bb7a921cdc1e6af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这家伙也是、那家伙也是！\n全都看不起我！\n那我就要赢给他们看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0eab0477a18915f7404396ed321dcc1e8f63f3549b3c364c7c010f22bd9e5e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:499d5139d06dea8660c22f17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "背负这么多期待，反而有些困扰了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a75796621540268ecbbd217ee79310d0a207efac78a888b5715a4d3049c6657",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3c2c8103ff65eff181cbb2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我尽力而为吧……尽力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "162e4cbd8960267d479cf42b8639a3c2efae33c62e873a65cb4fada4616f6180",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c7d1906455067ac95d03e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等级提升……也就这种感觉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e84c0b45eea25c170b90e8b266f860863def8f90cc9dc71a2a1133b7b9ae1a7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab051a943cd313b8ff75ff26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出力提升……能行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a34e104d2d90f9d240047f54ffe48aef8493531f26ca97fc115dc460b88bb0be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed13908d69c6c69aa47c6fee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是坏到四分五裂……\r\n我也会无数次地将它修好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f1cc3a0a21a1adf16238fe0df22a0e369c107b71d26e7f1d44293aeec3f569",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f93ad5d89f1a7b6e567ac3f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成田大进。\r\n你就是助手？……这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e869883f1f440eae395d968f1349df6a70d56edfd0b3ad7a0b79cc283dc9452",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5b22b4178c56e0a089be259",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アップデートはしていかないとね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "309bcfb3f99fa7d6e8098773c95772fd70c8132043b49c7d6b5219dc8dcb974f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ee726fe3fa56f0fedbb441",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限界って、突破するもんでしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e75052e136fbe49a48b045874b8e41ff53725f89754b5018893d8e2f735fbcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:404e82c81ab10905d74b9c9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有象無象のノイズなんて、\r\nフルブーストでかき消してやる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69354f682c5094efdd203cb1229364a1f84f099078e1734850cfb1379651b3ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:589c13d3e723ec504606c604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ナリタタイシン。\r\nアタシのターン、始めるよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fd7d852e870689b6222f418ef9cf50d2ee1fb5e32946d98f716b13ef3715737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1050",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10aba1ceb24562ec25fa0010",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b58d964d17854a803d16140a894079104ae8c9281e306d5f49a7ec42fc0837d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aa3610fa83940023de85712",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用我的表现替大家带来勇气……\r\n我要和训练员一起努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "426654848b8baab340ae61ea5c1052357394b7af6978ed8cc284f423be757cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601a8bbc5ce39b181ed8345b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2746adcd39fdf414dbc71ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま帰りましたっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16bf5f790acc52a1ff5f3ff54960e35e09cd3f2ce1d51f4b726df01647b94044",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fefc223d14d065dbbafb509d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然现在还很小，\r\n但将来一定能成为漂亮的花朵……\r\n我现在已经能够相信自己了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94fae4cf458619a8622e7d47a5844866ce9cbc080a8de3b567b21c530cb6decf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf7d77d06adfe295820ab0c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要一起去野餐？\r\n顺便一起做便当……然后，\r\n我想和你在花田尽情聊天♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb57eed94523506c9aa0b28d13cdcebee671eab2f1d01f87aae2e0a39b40640a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:458352deac560792fd30c043",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃了自己做的年菜后，\r\n就会觉得新的一年真的到了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ee7fdf141268747d89ef198f1654d5bbdf7dacf5e1ab60745afc7e825e6f107",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:141a78998b01ac6519409479",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明是情人节，\r\n大家却都拜托我做萩饼。\r\n是因为喜欢我做的萩饼吗……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a09b881a0fa7c4f17fac2b875804d0f92e373668915b55c08e986906e7e8c678",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61c0c9e898db2881319e4c94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我用各种口味的巧克力，\r\n做成花坛的样子！就当作是感谢\r\n你平时的照顾……请收下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f84f4af66736c106b24a684c4dea9ed2076c240372edf578c9bf68f8711181f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f70fcfac47a5ae6c540a43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在短签上写好愿望了吗？\r\n我想再长大一点……\r\n啊，不对，这是秘密！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bfbfa26f28c9bcf71e3cc12ffea6e014197a682527d95869c6939d68a13be76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "10006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
